WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.000
SILVER  FANG

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.110
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:08.610
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.420
SILVER  FANG
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.780
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER  FANG

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:30.030
<i>To become the leader of Ou, Sniper
has fooled Ben and Moss into fighting.</i>

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:36.270
<i>Ben ends up under a big rock
that Moss pushed down.</i>

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:42.040
<i>Meanwhile, Silver has been hunted
down in a river by Sniper and Hyena-</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:46.950
<i>- but managed to pull up both
himself and Smith on land.</i>

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:54.200
<i>Silver ran as fast as he
could to tell Ben and Moss.</i>

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:55.710
<i>But...</i>

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:06.520
NINJA DOGS!
A DARK SHADOW OVER IGA!

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.060
Big brother!

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:13.520
Akatora!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.150
Big brother!

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.080
Silver!

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:29.830
Stop! It's a trap!

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.290
You little...!

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:36.710
Wait! Moss, Jaguar lives!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.460
We did not attack Jaguar!

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.220
Is it true?

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:44.470
Ben!

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.970
Ben, where are you?
It was Sniper who attacked Jaguar!

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.600
Silver and I saw it with our own eyes!

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:55.110
What do you say?

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:00.110
Ben! Where are you, Ben!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.610
Silver...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.160
Ben...

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.410
Ben is...

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:08.830
What is it?

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.540
What is it, Cross?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.520
Cross...

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.710
Silver!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:20.800
Ben is right under your feet.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.340
Ben!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.850
How did this happen?

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:34.850
Ben!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.310
Who?

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.610
Who did this to Ben?!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.860
Kid!
Did you say Jaguar lives?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:56.120
Males! First we will find Jaguar.
We can finish this later!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:57.870
Crap!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.000
Was it you?
Was it you who killed Ben?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:06.760
Move! Otherwise you
will be as flat as Ben.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.380
Damn!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:11.950
Silver!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.430
You will die! You will die!

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.520
That small one...

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:23.110
Why did you do this to Ben?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.860
You... You bastard!

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.360
What a kid!

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.530
Don't come here!
Observe!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.580
Silver!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.710
Moss!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:47.220
It's... It's me you wanna fight!
He's just a kid!

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:52.220
Kid, you say?
But he is brave.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:05:00.970
Little kid. Are you claiming that
he is worth risking your life for, huh?

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:04.980
That... you will never find out!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.360
Your bastard!

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:09.460
Silver!

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.870
Ben...

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.600
Ben!

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.500
Little shit...

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:24.000
He... wounded Moss!

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.500
Kid!
You will regret this in hell!

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:30.820
Moss from The Misty Mountain has never
let anyone live-

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.260
- who's seen his blood!

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.670
Run, Silver! Escape!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.770
Wait...! Father!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.900
Jaguar! You are alive!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:53.840
It's true!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.240
It's Jaguar!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:06:01.990
Father! It's a trap!
The male here, Silver... saved me.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:09.000
Yes, the kid is a real male.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:11.170
But you arrived too late.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:15.680
I've been told that we were tricked.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:20.700
But the war has already begun!
We can't stop it!

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:21.920
Father!

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.430
Right, kid? Your eyes say...

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:29.980
you can't rest until you
have avenged Ben, huh?

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:36.990
Males!

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:42.250
Then we continue the fight!
Kid, attack whenever you want.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.140
Of course!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.300
Wait!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.250
Wait, Silver!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:07.930
Ben!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:14.730
Silver... you make so much noise
that I can't even rest in peace!

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:21.950
Ben!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.290
Ben!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.590
Ben! You are alive!

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.840
He's really alive!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.090
What a male!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.590
A monster!

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.600
Moss...

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:47.060
We are friends.
And friends should not fight each other.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:51.980
That's right, father.
And they are looking for males!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.360
They are fighting Akakabuto...

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:54.620
Be quiet.
They are fighting Akakabuto...

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.730
Be quiet.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.490
Looking for males, huh?

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:02.490
Well then, Ben! Can I see what
you're made of?!

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:06.740
Come at me and show this Moss from
The Misty Mountain what you can do!

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.870
The male is measured by his strength!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:14.870
Don't bullshit me,
before you have beaten me!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.550
Ben! Beware!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.740
Father!

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:33.400
Father!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.530
Boss!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:35.990
Father!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:36.840
Bastard!

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:37.280
No! Wait!
Bastard!

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.690
No! Wait!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.530
No one interferes without
father's orders!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:57.750
Jaguar... Finally you begin to look
like a king over The Misty Mountain.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:02.050
But you need even more training
to become a real male.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.550
You there!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:10.270
Moss from The Misty Mountain and fifty
males are under your command.

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:11.690
Moss...

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:16.480
I've heard about Akakabuto.
He lives in the Twin Pass in Ou, huh?

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.990
Great place for me to die in.
Prepare, males!

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.750
Father...

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:34.490
We don't fight to die.
We'll fight to live!

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:40.290
Good. Then I'll make sure
to live to 100!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.680
Thanks, Moss.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:59.690
Oh, you silly.
It's too early for you.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.210
Dammit!

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.670
Mr. Sniper, what are we going to do?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.380
What about me...?

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.800
Okay...

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.510
Mr. Sniper...?

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:29.800
You will see...
A sniper never gives up!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:52.830
<i>Moss chose to follow Ben and
they left The Misty Mountain behind.</i>

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:05.090
<i>Ben's platoon was now at 70 males.</i>

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.590
<i>A real giant platoon!</i>

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:14.340
<i>The 70 dogs ran for two
whole days south towards Mie-</i>

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:19.100
<i>- to reach the village of IGA,
the origins of the ninjas.</i>

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.800
Finally in Mie...

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.800
We will probably stay here
for a long time.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:12:00.560
A long time?
What do you mean, Ben?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.810
There is a mighty male here.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.820
We will easily win with
this number.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:10.570
And the old man Moss is in good shape.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.580
What "old man"? Little kai dog!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:22.580
It's not about being
able to defeat him.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:29.800
A male with a heavy duty, Ben?

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:34.800
Yes. If he still is the
dog I remember...

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:49.160
Stupid! Stay out of it!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.490
We told you we got him!

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.170
Unbelievable!

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.800
We've got a good butcher! But I don't
think he wants to be called that.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.810
Old man,you're insanely strong!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.980
If you'd been as quick
as we are, when we fought-

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.650
- we would've been in trouble!
Right, right?

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:30.190
Watch your mouth or you
won't get any meat.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:33.690
I was just kidding, old man.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.950
It was just a joke you know.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:50.400
Ben, it's wonderful
that you survived.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.210
I think so too, Cross.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:56.720
Hell doesn't seem so nice.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:15.110
<i>Dammit... I'm so hungry!</i>

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.640
<i>Mr. Sniper is so mean.</i>

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:24.500
<i>He orders me, but how
can I return to the pack.</i>

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.670
What's this...!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.270
Aren't you're hungry? Eat up!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.760
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.820
What is it, Silver?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.230
I thought I heard Hyena.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.500
Hyena?

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.600
What do you want?

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.850
Are you friends with the
pack down there?

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.350
Yes!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.280
If you touch me,
they will take revenge!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:36.030
Then I have a warning to your friends.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:41.360
Not a step further
into this area! Understand?!

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:43.840
Pass it on!

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:47.750
They just...

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:55.000
If you do not obey, you will all die.
Just so you know!

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.820
So it was Hyena!

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:17.650
Your bastard! How dare you!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.490
No, Jaguar!

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:23.240
Move, Akatora!
It was his fault that Lloyd...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:26.490
I know! I also want to kill him!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:33.750
But it is Ben who is the leader.
He decides.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:37.200
You should know.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:39.250
Isn't that right, Jaguar?

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:02.910
Where's the office... I mean Sniper.
I want to talk to him.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:07.480
I do not know!
He threatened to kill me if I didn't...

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:12.370
Liar! You didn't look
frightened at all!

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:18.870
No stop! It's true.
Sniper would've killed me if I didn't...

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:27.470
It's true! Cross!
Can't you tell Ben?

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.260
Silver...!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:41.240
Dirty cowards like you...
have no place in my pack!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:42.720
Ben!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.070
Should we kill him, Ben?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.570
Ben! You shouldn't dirty
your paws!

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:50.040
That's right! He is not worth
your energy.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:51.170
I can...

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.000
No, I will!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:52.210
Wait!
No, I will!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:52.750
Wait!

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:59.400
Jaguar... He's mine.
I'll take care of him!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.350
Ben!

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.690
This is enough for today.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:25.690
But next time you
know what to expect.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.450
If you want to be forgiven,
bring Sniper to us!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.700
Understood?!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.460
No good!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.460
You are too gullible, Ben.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.880
Sorry, Moss. Hold on, Jaguar.

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:43.650
I'd rather forgive than kill.

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:50.630
Jaguar, we have to
do as Ben says.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.140
I understand, father.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:56.390
We need to hurry.

00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:01.150
He had a very nice piece
of meat though.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:02.340
Wait!

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:05.650
I haven't eaten anything in two days!
Please give it back.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:09.980
Be grateful that you still
live, damn traitor!

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:13.660
Smith! Stop it!
Return it.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:17.230
I know, Silver.
I just teased a bit.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.410
Here!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.170
Th-Thanks!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:29.670
What is this smell?
Where did you get that meat from?

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.760
Don't try to steal it, it's mine!

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:38.760
Idiot! Spit it out!
Don't you know what that is?

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:43.650
This is...

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.420
dog meat!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.830
What did you say?

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:00.290
Akatora... is that true?

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.540
Don't joke around.

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.300
I'm not joking!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:09.320
Damn cannibal. You'll die!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:19.690
I haven't done anything!
Really! I got it for free!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.430
By who?

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.200
Who are you?

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:37.200
Th-They! They gave me the meat!

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:38.230
What?

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.120
They disappeared!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.190
It's...!

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:20.620
Silver! Beware! Above you!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:28.090
Silver!

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:34.810
Silver!

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:38.470
Silver!

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:48.730
They move like squirrels!

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:52.110
Ben, are they the ones
you talked about?

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:55.730
Yes. Ninja dogs from IGA.

00:21:55.860 --> 00:21:57.870
IGA? Ninja Dogs?

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:03.620
They practice ninjutsu.
Their leader is Akame from the IGA.

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:09.380
Akame from IGA?
Does he let his males eat dogs?

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:12.630
No, he wouldn't.

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:16.850
If I knew, I would never
have taken you here.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.940
But...

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:21.810
But that is...

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>Silver, received a horrific
air attack from the ninjas.</i>

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:54.460
<i>And who is their leader, Akame?</i>

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:59.460
<i>Is he really a male, Silver and
the others are looking for?</i>
